Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:01.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Number two: three
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.70,0:00:03.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,thin steel cables.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.45,0:00:04.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,A car that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.15,0:00:05.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,crosses the median
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.46,0:00:06.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,is headed straight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.54,0:00:08.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,into oncoming traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:09.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,So three steel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.67,0:00:10.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,ropes are strung
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.59,0:00:11.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,tight between
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.37,0:00:12.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,flimsy posts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:13.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,When a car
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.69,0:00:14.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,hits them, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.63,0:00:15.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,posts just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.35,0:00:16.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,fold over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.58,0:00:17.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,The cables stretch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:18.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,back like a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.40,0:00:19.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,slingshot, about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.90,0:00:20.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,eight feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.97,0:00:22.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,That long stretch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.07,0:00:23.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,slows the car
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.05,0:00:24.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,gently instead of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:25.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,stopping it dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:26.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then the tension
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.49,0:00:27.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,steers it back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:28.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,along the median,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:29.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,away from the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.39,0:00:30.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,other lanes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.70,0:00:31.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.25,0:00:31.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.14,0:00:32.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's a giant
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.93,0:00:33.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,steel net.
